DESCRIPTION:[Ben McNally Books Social]\nJoin us at Ben McNally Books for o
 ur inaugural Social!\nWe're hosting a little get together. We'll have some
  nibbles and some drinkies\, and we invite you to come join the festivitie
 s.\nWe'll do a bit of a presentation to talk about some recent favourite b
 ooks\, some news\, as well as well as some upcoming plans for the shop.\n\
 nBut\, more than anything\, we wanted to create a space for people to ming
 le and socialize and get to know fellow booklovers.
LOCATION:Ben McNally Books
URL:https://shop.benmcnallybooks.com/events
X-SOURCE:Ben McNally Books
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:August Book Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260830T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260830T123000
UID:bm-5630520260830@shop.benmcnallybooks.com
DESCRIPTION:[BMB Book Club]\nWe hope that you'll join us to talk about the
  book\, enjoy a cookie\, and get a bit of exclusive access to the store.\n
 Continuing on with our year of reading first novels by established authors
 \, our August pick is Player Piano by Kurt Vonnegut. Something with a bi
 t of levity\, is the hope\, even if the premise involves the world being r
 un by computers.\nPlease note: you'll need to buy a ticket to the meeting 
 if you're hoping to attend. However\, you won't be charged for the ticket 
 if you also buy a copy of the book.
LOCATION:Ben McNally Books
URL:https://shop.benmcnallybooks.com/events
X-SOURCE:Ben McNally Books
END:VEVENT
